    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;How many cosmic hearts will our cats heal today?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Cat Caf\u00e9</strong> is a purr-fect blend of feline nurturing and interstellar management. As the manager of the galaxy's quirkiest cat caf\u00e9, you'll team up with cosmic kitties to soothe alien souls on a distant frontier planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/b3ce41560fbf3ed4d670cd2a8676d10e.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auriga V</strong> drifts through space like a celestial message bottle, harboring stranded starfarers from crashed ships. Cut off from their homeworlds, these frustrated crews teeter on the brink of galactic-scale meltdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hyperspace jump mishap strands you on Auriga V\u2014until fate introduces you to the planet's twin-tailed <strong>Meowmeows</strong>. These miraculous fluffballs radiate anxiety-dissolving aura through their cloud-soft fur. Now you're building the universe's first interstellar cat caf\u00e9! Design stress-melting bio-pods for alien patrons, craft interstellar cat cuisine, and invent cosmic beverages. Every choice shapes your sanctuary's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When claw-sharp cosmic loneliness meets paw-sitive purr therapy, can your Meowmeow magic dispel light-year-spanning gloom? Fire up the holographic menu, tie that apron, and let the healing begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.poster.avif?t=1744268713\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.webm?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.mp4?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/b5f0a6f7f63aceadd9ee087685f349ae.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up Deepsea Slushies for octopus engineers while baking Circuit-Board Crunchies for queuing robots. Cook solo or train cats as sous-chefs! Balance your cats' work/rest schedules\u2014happy staff radiate better vibes. Use &quot;petting revenue&quot; to upgrade kitchen gear, install anti-gravity cat trees, and unlock 50+ decor items. Expand your bio-dome while optimizing alien traffic flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.poster.avif?t=1744268713\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.webm?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.mp4?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/083753bc2bdd296a87ef80f62ce62098.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock self-upgrading kitchen gear through feline achievements. Watch sleepy purrs power your Nebula Latte Art Printer! Craft modular star-colony cat towers and self-transforming Nebula Carpets. Blend octopus fluidic aesthetics with robotic minimalism via nano-printers: semi-solid floors to lure slimes, quantum-entangling Stellar Rings, fur-reactive walls glowing with fading pawprints. When anti-gravity catwalks merge with biotech vines in cyber-Zen harmony, your caf\u00e9 becomes the ultimate cure for cosmic solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;How many cosmic hearts will our cats heal today?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Cat Caf\u00e9</strong> is a purr-fect blend of feline nurturing and interstellar management. As the manager of the galaxy's quirkiest cat caf\u00e9, you'll team up with cosmic kitties to soothe alien souls on a distant frontier planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/b3ce41560fbf3ed4d670cd2a8676d10e.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auriga V</strong> drifts through space like a celestial message bottle, harboring stranded starfarers from crashed ships. Cut off from their homeworlds, these frustrated crews teeter on the brink of galactic-scale meltdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hyperspace jump mishap strands you on Auriga V\u2014until fate introduces you to the planet's twin-tailed <strong>Meowmeows</strong>. These miraculous fluffballs radiate anxiety-dissolving aura through their cloud-soft fur. Now you're building the universe's first interstellar cat caf\u00e9! Design stress-melting bio-pods for alien patrons, craft interstellar cat cuisine, and invent cosmic beverages. Every choice shapes your sanctuary's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When claw-sharp cosmic loneliness meets paw-sitive purr therapy, can your Meowmeow magic dispel light-year-spanning gloom? Fire up the holographic menu, tie that apron, and let the healing begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.poster.avif?t=1744268713\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.webm?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/cc7f6ca5692c7164810c372d3fd22bac.mp4?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/b5f0a6f7f63aceadd9ee087685f349ae.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up Deepsea Slushies for octopus engineers while baking Circuit-Board Crunchies for queuing robots. Cook solo or train cats as sous-chefs! Balance your cats' work/rest schedules\u2014happy staff radiate better vibes. Use &quot;petting revenue&quot; to upgrade kitchen gear, install anti-gravity cat trees, and unlock 50+ decor items. Expand your bio-dome while optimizing alien traffic flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.poster.avif?t=1744268713\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.webm?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/48e5a57d3dc98307fc934b24e659d7b8.mp4?t=1744268713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589390/extras/083753bc2bdd296a87ef80f62ce62098.avif?t=1744268713\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock self-upgrading kitchen gear through feline achievements. Watch sleepy purrs power your Nebula Latte Art Printer! Craft modular star-colony cat towers and self-transforming Nebula Carpets. Blend octopus fluidic aesthetics with robotic minimalism via nano-printers: semi-solid floors to lure slimes, quantum-entangling Stellar Rings, fur-reactive walls glowing with fading pawprints. When anti-gravity catwalks merge with biotech vines in cyber-Zen harmony, your caf\u00e9 becomes the ultimate cure for cosmic solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
